type: software
title: "scrna-multidonor-pseudobulk: Reproducible multi-donor scRNA-seq Harmony integration and pseudobulk PyDESeq2 workflow"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-20
license: MIT
url: "https://arjunbioinfo.github.io/"
