  - pseudobulk
  - PyDESeq2
  - Scanpy
  - Snakemake
  - reproducible research
abstract: >-
  A config-driven Snakemake and Python workflow for multi-donor single-cell RNA-seq
  batch integration (Harmony), donor-level pseudobulk differential expression (PyDESeq2),
  single-cell vs. pseudobulk false-positive benchmarking, and cell-type pathway enrichment.
